      "writtenOn": "2023-03-15T01:39:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Why is some of this stuff in before_test() and some in test_init()? I guess test_init() runs one time and before_test() runs before each of your two tests?\n\nThat\u0027s correct.\nIn `test_init()`, I set eh GPIOs in a correct state (they can be both low at the same time).\nAfter that the system is coherent, it should not need extra setup.\nI need to know the state of the EC at the end a test to prevent the tablet counter to increase inadvertently.",
      "parentUuid": "4b19875a_a3221b39",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 67,
        "startChar": 0,
