      },
      "lineNbr": 92,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000107
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-17T16:27:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right. I understand that you need to wait, my hope was that you could wait for something more predictable. For example, is there some way to wait until all delayed functions currently pending have finished? When that happens then you know you\u0027re done.",
      "parentUuid": "f693cb2a_cf5615c6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 92,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 92,
        "endChar": 12
      },
      "revId": "493d627698a814ca06f7dcbaa767c0458023720c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
